# Raw IL dump trees. POLICY: bulk game IL lives ONLY under the repo-root il/
# tree, which is git-ignored wholesale. Nothing under tools/ should ever contain
# dumped game IL; if a tool run lands output here, move it to il/ rather than
# adding another name to this file. The catch-all below is a backstop, not a
# licence to keep dumps in tools/.
*.il.txt
*/*.il.txt

# Python bytecode from the test scripts.
__pycache__/
